GET /v2/{name}
Gets smart notes by smart note ID. For more information, see [Work with artifacts](https://developers.google.com/workspace/meet/api/guides/artifacts).
Required: name (path) — Required. Resource name of the smart note. Format: conferenceRecords/{conference_record}/smartNotes/{smart_note}
Optional: fields (query) — Field mask limiting which response fields are returned, e.g. sheets.properties.
